    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d37">

                <pb facs="0155" n="47" xml:id="pg47"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September 8,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham instructs Mr. Thompson to concert with other legations and make by
                    separate note representations to the Brazilian Government in regard to the
                    suspension of telegraphic intercourse, by which, especially at this time,
                    commerce suffers serious injury.</p>
            </div>
